goal ProtectData { informalDef = "The data shall be protected" }
requirement EncryptData { formalDef = "DataIsEncrypted" }
object Data
action Encrypt
agent EncryptionService { realm = "software" }

EncryptData reduces ProtectData
ProtectData concerns Data
Data ensures EncryptData
Encrypt operationalizes EncryptData
EncryptionService is responsible for EncryptData
EncryptionService performs Encrypt
EncryptionService is capable of Encrypt
EncryptionService monitors Data
EncryptionService controls Data
Encrypt has input Data
Encrypt has output Data